00:47:07,058 --> 00:47:13,058
Bad Taste is a 1987 New Zealand science-fiction action comedy horror film
written, produced, filmed, directed by and co-starring Peter Jackson.

10
00:52:21,176 --> 00:52:27,176
Independently produced on a low budget, it is Jackson's first feature film.

11
00:57:35,294 --> 00:57:41,294
Jackson and friends take on most of the key roles, both on and off-screen.

12
01:02:49,411 --> 01:02:55,411
The plotline sees aliens invade the fictional New Zealand village of Kaihoro to harvest humans for their
intergalactic fast food franchise, where they face off against a four-man paramilitary force.

13
01:08:03,529 --> 01:08:09,529
The film was shot in Northern Wellington over the course of four years, and eventually received nearly a quarter of a million dollars in
New Zealand Film Commission assistance, providing Jackson with the leverage necessary to advance in the film industry.

14
01:13:17,647 --> 01:13:23,647
Since its release, Bad Taste has become a cult film
and has received stronger reviews.

15
01:18:31,764 --> 01:18:37,764
In 2008, British film magazine Empire ranked Bad Taste
as the 416th greatest film ever made.

16
01:23:45,882 --> 01:23:51,882
The tone is lighthearted.
